CHIPIX 1.0.0
© 2026 Structural Bioinformatics & Bioactive Compound Synthesis Lab - UFRO

CHIPIX provides an independent ChimeraX implementation of docking and pose
consensus workflows inspired by DockingPie for PyMOL.

Original DockingPie authors: Serena Rosignoli and Alessandro Paiardini.
The original consensus scoring class, copyright 2022 Serena Rosignoli,
is included verbatim under tests/reference solely for regression comparison.
Original project: https://github.com/paiardin/DockingPie
Publication: https://doi.org/10.1093/bioinformatics/btac452

The CHIPIX source code is provided under GPL-3.0-or-later; see LICENSE.
AutoDock Vina is a separate external program under Apache-2.0. Its original
license accompanies the optional binary in engines/AutoDock-Vina-LICENSE.
The supplied branding image is included unchanged in assets/chipix-logo.png.
